From 75703bc037c277d62b1abd2758483b17225da32d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hectorqin <14220132+hectorqin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:00:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] fix(agent-api): drop Codex default permission mode;
 document which modes ask

The Codex runtime cannot surface approval requests, so a Codex run in
`default` mode could never have a request answered. Accept only
bypassPermissions and acceptEdits (workspace-write sandbox, never asks)
for Codex, and state in the docs and route comment that approval
requests appear only for Claude default/acceptEdits and OpenCode default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 public/api-docs.html                          |  2 +-
 server/modules/agent/agent.routes.ts          | 20 +++++++++++--------
 .../modules/agent/tests/agent.routes.test.ts  |  4 +++-
 3 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

